{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-breadcrumb",
  "category": "navigation",
  "title": "<iswc-breadcrumb>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos de iswc-breadcrumb e iswc-breadcrumb-item de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-breadcrumb",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Migas de pan accesibles con marcado <code class=\"code\">&lt;nav&gt;</code>,\r\n          ARIA roles y separador automático entre items.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-breadcrumb label=\"Catálogo\">\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/\">Catálogo</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa\">Ropa</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa/mujer\">Mujer</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">Camisetas</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </iswc-breadcrumb>",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:label",
              "label": "label",
              "options": [
                "Catálogo",
                "Navegación SPA",
                "Inicio",
                "App",
                "Slash"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:href",
              "label": "href",
              "options": [
                "/",
                "/ropa",
                "/ropa/mujer",
                "",
                "/articulos",
                "/dashboard",
                "/users",
                "/home",
                "/docs"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-breadcrumb label=\"Catálogo\">\n  <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/\">Catálogo</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n  <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa\">Ropa</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n  <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa/mujer\">Mujer</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n  <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">Camisetas</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n</iswc-breadcrumb>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "spa",
      "title": "SPAs — eventos de click",
      "lede": "Sin <code class=\"code\">href</code>, los items se renderizan como texto sin enlace. Conecta tú los handlers.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-breadcrumb id=\"bcSpa\" label=\"Navegación SPA\">\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item>Inicio</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item>Productos</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item>Detalle</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </iswc-breadcrumb>\r\n          <p id=\"bcLog\">Última navegación: ninguna</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "bc.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n  const item = e.target.closest('iswc-breadcrumb-item');\n  if (item) console.log('item click', item.textContent.trim());\n});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "icons",
      "title": "Iconos en items",
      "lede": "Usa el atributo <code class=\"code\">icon</code> o el slot <code class=\"code\">start</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <iswc-breadcrumb label=\"Inicio\">\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/\" icon=\"mdi:home\">Inicio</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/articulos\" icon=\"mdi:newspaper-variant\">Artículos</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"\" icon=\"mdi:airplane\">Viajes</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </iswc-breadcrumb>\r\n\r\n          <iswc-breadcrumb label=\"App\">\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/dashboard\">\r\n              <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:view-dashboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>\r\n              Dashboard\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/users\">\r\n              <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:account-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>\r\n              Usuarios\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">\r\n              <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:account\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>\r\n              Perfil\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </iswc-breadcrumb>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-breadcrumb-item icon=\"mdi:home\">Inicio</iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n<iswc-breadcrumb-item>\n  <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:home\"></iswc-icon>\n  Inicio\n</iswc-breadcrumb-item>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "separator",
      "title": "Separador custom",
      "lede": "Cambia el slot <code class=\"code\">separator</code> de cada item — o sólo el último que se ignora.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-breadcrumb label=\"Slash\">\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/home\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Inicio\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/docs\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Docs\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Guía\r\n            </iswc-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </iswc-breadcrumb>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-breadcrumb-item href=\"/home\">\n  <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\n  Inicio\n</iswc-breadcrumb-item>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
